# Direct dependencies of the imports_container image.
#
# This is the file humans edit. Do not `pip install -r` it — install
# requirements.txt, the hashed lockfile compiled from it:
#
#   cd bin/python
#   uv pip compile requirements.in --output-file requirements.txt \
#       --generate-hashes --python-version 3.13 --python-platform linux
#
# Commit both files together. Dependabot (package-ecosystem: uv) re-runs the
# same compile for its bumps and regenerates the hashes. Python 3.13 is the
# Dockerfile's base image; CI runs the same interpreter so the lock resolves
# to the same tree in both places. Floors (>=) here are the minimum we
# accept; the lock is what actually installs.

