# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Transitive-dependency security floors. Nothing here is imported
# directly; the lines exist so the lockfile can never resolve a version with
# a known advisory. Before the lockfile these were `pip install 'pkg>=x'`
# lines in pytest.yml, so CI tested a newer tree than the image shipped.
# Drop a line when the parent package's own floor catches up.
